{"id":121255181515820,"name":"[BRUTUM] Pillar Chase [BETA]","desc":"WELCOME TO PILLAR CHASE!\n\nPillar Chase is a multiplayer horror game in which 1 or 2 players are a monster, and the rest are thrown into a match as survivors.\nSurvivors must do their tasks and escape; monsters must kill all players or stop them from escaping.\n\n- ALL CREDITS FOR CHARACTERS CAN BE FOUND UNDER THE INGAME MOVESET/INFORMATION TABS.","path":"/game/121255181515820-pillar-chase","slug":"121255181515820-pillar-chase","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/e97cecf8682e412e10434890f41a0bcbd3e92f05afafb1633d07fe8b64c47bb9.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-b2991e8b0287c3e932d5a1b34d4b67a1/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":170,"visitor":11341729,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-05-26T11:37:59.633Z","creator":{"name":"TBN : Pillar Chase 2","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"BRUTUM-Pillar-Chase-BETA-Infinite-Stamina-224423","_id":"6a1586175f9bca73cd5a4d79","title":"Infinite Stamina","game":{"_id":"69f84534768647f1399eb6d4","gameId":121255181515820,"name":"[BRUTUM] Pillar Chase [BETA]","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":121255181515820},"features":"Execute script in lobby or in match (or whenever u want lol) and your stamina will stop draining (It's still can be drained by some things as jumping or other stuff) but 1 stamina is enough to run endlessly","tags":[],"script":"local player = game:GetService(\"Players\").LocalPlayer\n\nwhile true do\n\tlocal charFolder = workspace:FindFirstChild(player.Name)\n\n\tif charFolder and charFolder:FindFirstChild(\"Aspects\") then\n\t\tlocal stamina = charFolder.Aspects:FindFirstChild(\"Stamina\")\n\n\t\tif stamina then\n\t\t\tif stamina:FindFirstChild(\"DrainSpeed\") then\n\t\t\t\tstamina.DrainSpeed.Value = 0\n\t\t\tend\n\n\t\t\tif stamina:FindFirstChild(\"DrainAmount\") then\n\t\t\t\tstamina.DrainAmount.Value = 0\n\t\t\tend\n\t\tend\n\tend\n\n\ttask.wait(3)\nend","owner":{"_id":"673359e0bdaef29285037406","username":"StewBradar","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/b5a562b87d03bd9795fde9235d0443bcbb62bab815f5ac605592ead2d327f103.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/673359e0bdaef29285037406-1790446588742.png"},"status":"offline","id":"673359e0bdaef29285037406","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","tier":10000},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/b5a562b87d03bd9795fde9235d0443bcbb62bab815f5ac605592ead2d327f103.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/673359e0bdaef29285037406-1790446588742.png"}},"verified":false,"views":1438,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/7ddb5e35452a9db17e782aba28b9350e228e56d01bdce8630b2b796f14ddeee6.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/rbx-79754650f4c22129d5a28b3f5862c88f-897a88e3dd14.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/rbx-79754650f4c22129d5a28b3f5862c88f-897a88e3dd14.png"},"likeCount":3,"dislikeCount":1,"createdAt":"2026-05-26T11:37:59.639Z","executes":1135,"keyless":false,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-18T02:03:15.505Z","last":"","win":14,"math":3},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/7ddb5e35452a9db17e782aba28b9350e228e56d01bdce8630b2b796f14ddeee6.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/rbx-79754650f4c22129d5a28b3f5862c88f-897a88e3dd14.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/rbx-79754650f4c22129d5a28b3f5862c88f-897a88e3dd14.png"},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"6a1586175f9bca73cd5a4d7b","editBy":{"_id":"673359e0bdaef29285037406","username":"StewBradar","status":"